<title>SWITZERLAND: Deutsche Finance sets 500 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Finance sets 500 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Finance N.V. set a 10-year 500 million Swiss franc bond via lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and CSFB, Deutsche Bank (Suisse) said.</p>
<p>BORROWER - = Deutsche Finance N.V.</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - = Deutsche Morgan Grenfell/CSFB</p>
<p> AMT   =  500 MLN CHF COUPON  =  3.75	MATURITY = 17.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE  STR		ISS PRICE= 102.50    PAY DATE = 17.JUL 97</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
